{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cubactory",
    "steam_appid": 2816490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816490/extras/7bce59d3ac8b6f98e1826a55a35f0ba2.avif?t=1749721867\" width=600 height=160 /></span><br><strong>Join the official Cubactory Discord and become part of the community now!</strong> Keep up to date with all the latest news, find out before anyone else about special events, receive exclusive information and share strategies (or cube memes) with like-minded players.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816490/extras/3505c47a7e37a7063dc051af1af8ebee.avif?t=1749721867\" width=600 height=136 /></span><br>Turn your modular factory into the best automated structure in the world and <strong>create voxel figures only you can imagine</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816490/extras/742ff700625e9768bf81d57c45af0d14.avif?t=1749721867\" width=600 height=72 /></span>With Cubactory you will embark on the only factory game where you actually build objects, your ingenuity and creativity will be challenged as you build and optimize a state-of-the-art modular factory. Your mission is to transform cubes of various materials into impressive voxel figures, fulfilling increasingly challenging orders that will test your engineering and optimization skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816490/extras/bf36cb27877f242e5f14431c4c4a1d64.avif?t=1749721867\" width=600 height=72 /></span>Your factory has advanced tools that allow you to manipulate colored cubes: merge them to create new materials, mix them to obtain precise color shades, tile them to shape them, or compact them to assemble complex structures. With each completed order you will earn money so that you can expand your factory exponentially and without limits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816490/extras/fb4fac48b951d0dc3c1d17fa6a83fb0a.avif?t=1749721867\" width=600 height=72 /></span>You start with basic tools and a handful of cubes, but soon you'll unlock advanced technologies that will transform your factory into a precision automated system. You use conveyor belts to move cubes between workstations, where specialized machines process them according to the specifications of each order. As orders become more complex, you'll need to optimize your production, balancing efficiency and creativity to meet color, shape and composition requirements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816490/extras/15d70ea5f8150ef248a06e1aece33ed0.avif?t=1749721867\" width=600 height=72 /></span>The key to success lies in automation. Design networks of conveyor belts that snake through your factory, connecting machines that perform specific tasks. Cubactory not only challenges you to follow orders, but gives you total freedom to experiment. Design unique voxel shapes, explore innovative combinations and create objects that reflect your vision. Whether following orders or inventing your own creations, the possibilities are almost endless.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816490/extras/3505c47a7e37a7063dc051af1af8ebee.avif?t=1749721867\" width=600 height=136 /></span><br>Turn your modular factory into the best automated structure in the world and <strong>create voxel figures only you can imagine</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816490/extras/742ff700625e9768bf81d57c45af0d14.avif?t=1749721867\" width=600 height=72 /></span>With Cubactory you will embark on the only factory game where you actually build objects, your ingenuity and creativity will be challenged as you build and optimize a state-of-the-art modular factory. Your mission is to transform cubes of various materials into impressive voxel figures, fulfilling increasingly challenging orders that will test your engineering and optimization skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816490/extras/bf36cb27877f242e5f14431c4c4a1d64.avif?t=1749721867\" width=600 height=72 /></span>Your factory has advanced tools that allow you to manipulate colored cubes: merge them to create new materials, mix them to obtain precise color shades, tile them to shape them, or compact them to assemble complex structures. With each completed order you will earn money so that you can expand your factory exponentially and without limits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816490/extras/fb4fac48b951d0dc3c1d17fa6a83fb0a.avif?t=1749721867\" width=600 height=72 /></span>You start with basic tools and a handful of cubes, but soon you'll unlock advanced technologies that will transform your factory into a precision automated system. You use conveyor belts to move cubes between workstations, where specialized machines process them according to the specifications of each order. As orders become more complex, you'll need to optimize your production, balancing efficiency and creativity to meet color, shape and composition requirements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816490/extras/15d70ea5f8150ef248a06e1aece33ed0.avif?t=1749721867\" width=600 height=72 /></span>The key to success lies in automation. Design networks of conveyor belts that snake through your factory, connecting machines that perform specific tasks. Cubactory not only challenges you to follow orders, but gives you total freedom to experiment. Design unique voxel shapes, explore innovative combinations and create objects that reflect your vision. Whether following orders or inventing your own creations, the possibilities are almost endless.",
    "short_description": "Cubactory is the only factory game where you truly build objects freely, transforming, blending, carving and compacting colored cubes into intricate voxel figures while automating your modular factory to meet increasingly complex orders.",
